  <div class="container">
    <div class="card" id="news">
      <h2>Latest Zelda News</h2>
      <p>The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom continues to captivate fans with its massive open world and intricate puzzles. Rumors swirl about a future DLC expansion that may introduce new dungeons and gameplay mechanics.</p>
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e3/The_Legend_of_Zelda_Tears_of_the_Kingdom_cover.jpg" alt="Tears of the Kingdom cover art">
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="games">
      <h2>Game Catalog</h2>
      <p>From the pixelated charm of the original NES classic to the sweeping landscapes of Breath of the Wild, explore every adventure Link has taken through the ages.</p>
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0e/Legend_of_zelda_logo.png" alt="Zelda logo">
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="guides">
      <h2>Walkthroughs & Tips</h2>
      <p>Discover hidden secrets, shrine locations, Korok seed maps, and expert tips on how to defeat the toughest bosses. Whether you're a new adventurer or a seasoned hero, our guides will help you master every challenge.</p>
      <h3>Popular Shrine Guides</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>In-Isa Shrine (Great Sky Island)</strong> – Use the Fuse ability to attach a boulder to your weapon to break through the rocks blocking your path. The shrine teaches you about creative combat.</li>
        <li><strong>Nachoyah Shrine</strong> – Located in the Temple of Time. Solve rotating platforms by combining the Recall ability with precise timing to cross gaps and reach the exit.</li>
        <li><strong>Ukouh Shrine</strong> – One of the first shrines you'll find. Learn the Ultrahand ability to move platforms and build bridges by connecting materials to navigate the environment.</li>
        <li><strong>Gutanbac Shrine</strong> – Introduces the Ascend ability. Look for green glows overhead to leap through ceilings and access new areas.</li>
      </ul>
      <img src="https://www.zeldadungeon.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Walkthrough_MainImage.jpg" alt="Zelda Dungeon Walkthrough">
    </div>
    <div class="card" id="community">
      <h2>Community Corner</h2>
      <p>Share your fan art, favorite game moments, cosplay photos, and theories about the Triforce and Zelda lore. Join forums, participate in events, and connect with other Hyrule warriors.</p>
